<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/85fb98baa5ba> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Tesla’s Autopilot has been involved in at least two other fatal collisions: the March 23rd, 2018 death of Wei “Walter” Huang in Mountain View, California." ;
