<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c86e74224f4a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The company declined to say when it learned of the fatality in China, or whether it had reported the crash to United States safety officials, who are investigating a fatal accident in Florida on May 7 in which Autopilot was engaged." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1559" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/ce635c76cb7d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[173] Tesla confirmed that its self-driving feature, Autopilot, was engaged in a fatal accident that occurred in California." ;
